Become a Certified AI Agent Builder with Oracle AI Agent Studio! 

Transform the way your organization works by learning to build AI agents within Oracle Fusion Applications. This learning path introduces you to Oracle AI Agent Studio and shows you how to apply generative AI to real business scenarios across HCM, Supply Chain Management, and ERP.

Through guided training, demos, and use cases, you'll learn to design and deploy AI agents that automate tasks and collaborate intelligently across enterprise systems.

Oracle AI Agent Studio empowers you to:

Understand the components and functionality of the AI Agent Studio environment.  (Fusion-native architecture, built-in capabilities, business objects, roles, workflows, and enterprise structures).
Understand various tools available to agents (Document tools, Business Object tools, External REST tools, Deep Link tools, and Email tools).
Describe human-in-the-loop mechanisms to enable human approval, 
Evaluate agent performance and quality using built-in testing tools.
Demonstration of real-world use of AI Agent Studio with pre-built templates and custom agents across HCM, ERP, SCM, and CX.
This training prepares you for the 1Z0-1145-1: Oracle Fusion AI Agent Studio Foundations Associate - Rel 1 certification exam.

